r role=\"presentation\"><span data-idx=\"9\" class=\"textLayerNode\" role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"left: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *62.54px); top: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *441.68px); font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *12.00px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(1.06837);\">Benchmark-Datensatz mit Version, Wahrheit und Auswerteskript</span></span><span class=\"markedContent\" id=\"p8R_mc7\"></span><span class=\"markedContent\" id=\"p8R_mc8\"><br role=\"presentation\"><span data-idx=\"11\" class=\"textLayerNode\" role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"left: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *62.54px); top: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *462.68px); font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *12.00px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(1.08575);\">Sensitivitätsstudie mit Fehlerbudget</span></span><span class=\"markedContent\" id=\"p8R_mc9\"></span><span class=\"markedContent\" id=\"p8R_mc10\"><br role=\"presentation\"><span data-idx=\"13\" class=\"textLayerNode\" role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"left: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *62.54px); top: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *483.68px); font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *12.00px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(1.11309);\">Schriftliche Arbeit</span></span><span class=\"markedContent\" id=\"p8R_mc11\"><br role=\"presentation\"><span data-idx=\"15\" class=\"textLayerNode\" role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"left: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *45.75px); top: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *509.18px); font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *12.00px); font-family: sans-serif; transform: scaleX(1.05617);\">Die Betreuung stellt bereit: Kameradaten, das gedruckte Testblatt mit Fotos, das</span><br role=\"presentation\"><span data-idx=\"16\" class=\"textLayerNode\" role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"left: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *45.75px); top: calc(var(--total-scale-factor) *527.18px); font-size: calc(var(--total-scale-fa